<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait T-bill balance falls in October.</title>
<headline>Kuwait T-bill balance falls in October.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The outstanding balance of treasury bills issued by Kuwait's Central Bank fell to 1.284 billion dinars at the end of October from 1.396 billion the previous month, a Central Bank bulletin said.</p>
<p>The outstanding balance of public debt instruments -- bonds and bills -- fell to 2.591 billion dinars at the end of October from 2.633 billion at the end of September.</p>
<p>The balance of public debt instruments was 2.818 billion in October 1995.</p>
<p>				 Data in million dinars</p>
<p>				 Oct '96		 Oct '95</p>
<p>Bills</p>
<p>  Matured		     408.9		   698.2</p>
<p>  New Issue		   296.6		   605.4</p>
<p>  Balance		   1,283.9		 2,008.8</p>
<p>Bonds</p>
<p>  Matured		     100.0		    58.9</p>
<p>  New Issue		   170.0		   100.0</p>
<p>  Balance		   1,307.0		   809.0</p>
<p>Slight discrepancies in figures are due to rounding.</p>
<p>-- Kuwait newsroom +965-240-8945</p>
